@startuml
!include _style.iuml
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam ArrowFontSize 16
skinparam NoteFontSize 14
skinparam maxMessageSize 400
hide footbox
autonumber
title Sequence view · UC-2 commits a live finish and its result outbox\n76282d3
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/worker/sqs.py#L109
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/messaging.py#L325
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/lifecycle.py#L136
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/lifecycle.py#L184
' Evidence: https://github.com/Collaboration95/dc2/blob/76282d3/processing/worker/sqs.py#L343
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam ArrowFontSize 17
skinparam NoteFontSize 17
skinparam LegendFontSize 17
skinparam maxMessageSize 350
participant "worker.sqs\n«module»" as W $PROC
participant "messaging\n«module»" as M $PROC
participant "lifecycle\n«module»" as L $PROC
participant "s: AsyncSession" as DB $INFRA
W -> M : finish(f,work,outputs=outputs)
activate M
M -> L : finish(f,work,outputs=outputs,error=None,on_change=emit_state)
activate L
note over L,DB : Validate exactly one primary + namespace + size/hash before SQL.
group Processing finish transaction
 L -> DB : SQL: lock_pair; DB clock; live fence
 opt live authority
  L -> DB : SQL: Job=done; Attempt=succeeded
  L -> M : emit_state(s,job,attempt)
  activate M
  M -> DB : SQL: increment version; stage result outbox
  M --> L : state_version: int
  deactivate M
 end
 L -> DB : COMMIT
end
L --> M : True if live; False if stale
deactivate L
M --> W : bool
deactivate M
legend bottom
Shown success request (error=None). Error finish instead records failed state and cleanup intent.
Work ACK follows finish commit; encoders stage result SQL, and a separate relay sends SQS.
endlegend
@enduml
